(4038658, 578248, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo - well lit and skin tones look gorgeous (the tip of the boot missing is a bit unfortunate, however). This does seem like a real stretch for the challenge, so 7.</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo - well lit and skin tones look gorgeous (the tip of the boot missing is a bit unfortunate, however). This does seem like a real stretch for the challenge, so 7.', '2007-08-29 13:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
