(4038675, 578349, 42100, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...I''m gonna guess either Brad or Bear on this mast photo.  The sunset colors are beautiful and the silhouetting simplifies the scene while keeping the pertinent details.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Hmmm...I''m gonna guess either Brad or Bear on this mast photo.  The sunset colors are beautiful and the silhouetting simplifies the scene while keeping the pertinent details.  Nicely done!', '2007-08-29 13:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
