(4038677, 577640, 66597, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot, but this seems like a real stretch for the challenge. A great photojournalism piece, however!</td>', 'Not a bad shot, but this seems like a real stretch for the challenge. A great photojournalism piece, however!', '2007-08-29 13:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
