(4038710, 578498, 42100, '<td valign="top">The downward angles definitely amplifies the sense of danger, and extended ladders are scary as hell on their own.  If you wanted to be really be mean...finding just the right artistic twist for this could of added a sense of vertigo and really freaked some people out.</td>', 'The downward angles definitely amplifies the sense of danger, and extended ladders are scary as hell on their own.  If you wanted to be really be mean...finding just the right artistic twist for this could of added a sense of vertigo and really freaked some people out.', '2007-08-29 13:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
