(4039953, 577868, 81362, '<td valign="top">Spot on for the challenge. Seems like the person could be focused a little sharper, but I enjoy the image a lot, plus it makes me get that funny feeling in the pit of the stomach.</td>', 'Spot on for the challenge. Seems like the person could be focused a little sharper, but I enjoy the image a lot, plus it makes me get that funny feeling in the pit of the stomach.', '2007-08-29 21:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4039962, 578341, 81362, '<td valign="top">Exactly without a net. Nice choice of perspective to have the cross piece at the same elevation as the clouds. With no ship or water visible, I get the uneasy feeling of a vessle moving high through the sky (but the sailors don''t look like the crew for Peter Pan). Wonderful image.</td>', 'Exactly without a net. Nice choice of perspective to have the cross piece at the same elevation as the clouds. With no ship or water visible, I get the uneasy feeling of a vessle moving high through the sky (but the sailors don''t look like the crew for Peter Pan). Wonderful image.', '2007-08-29 21:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4039967, 578349, 81362, '<td valign="top">Perfect positioning, great colors and exposure, exact fit with topic. 10</td>', 'Perfect positioning, great colors and exposure, exact fit with topic. 10', '2007-08-29 21:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4039987, 576965, 81362, '<td valign="top">Man are those poles long! Great image with the lines of the poles giving a bit of drama. I already got it that fishing with poles is different than fishing with a net. I fear many will reduce the score because of the title. After a small internal struggle, I concluded that your originality on the positive side makes up for the title on the negative side, at least well enough to not mark this down from an 8.</td>', 'Man are those poles long! Great image with the lines of the poles giving a bit of drama. I already got it that fishing with poles is different than fishing with a net. I fear many will reduce the score because of the title. After a small internal struggle, I concluded that your originality on the positive side makes up for the title on the negative side, at least well enough to not mark this down from an 8.', '2007-08-29 21:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4039990, 578394, 81362, '<td valign="top">I though that exactly this approach to the topic would be a fun entry, but with a manual typewriter - then didn''t enter anything. I love your choice of tone and leaving the network cable blue. Easily in my top 10 for this challenge.</td>', 'I though that exactly this approach to the topic would be a fun entry, but with a manual typewriter - then didn''t enter anything. I love your choice of tone and leaving the network cable blue. Easily in my top 10 for this challenge.', '2007-08-29 22:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4040009, 578548, 18738, '<td valign="top">I don''t know. It could be funny, but it''s definitely not clever. I''m tempted to vote high; unfortunately, the photo is too weak, even as a piss-take.<br/> <br/>I would advise a more elaborate fingering of the ''man'' in future.<br/> <br/>Though, if that really is a random guy in a car giving you the finger then the funny part is a little closer.</td>', 'I don''t know. It could be funny, but it''s definitely not clever. I''m tempted to vote high; unfortunately, the photo is too weak, even as a piss-take. I would advise a more elaborate fingering of the ''man'' in future. Though, if that really is a random guy in a car giving you the finger then the funny part is a little closer.', '2007-08-29 22:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
