(4040990, 577957, 14437, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is risky. However the contrast and leveling is out. Some post process of overall image adjustment could have made this photo much better.</td>', 'Wow, this is risky. However the contrast and leveling is out. Some post process of overall image adjustment could have made this photo much better.', '2007-08-30 06:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
