(4041107, 577868, 38032, '<td valign="top">Great use of rock-space.  Pretty much the perfect fit for the challenge too.  It also has just a hint of a where''s waldo thing going on with the orange shirt.</td>', 'Great use of rock-space.  Pretty much the perfect fit for the challenge too.  It also has just a hint of a where''s waldo thing going on with the orange shirt.', '2007-08-30 09:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4041110, 578171, 38032, '<td valign="top">COol - the subject and lighting are supreme.</td>', 'COol - the subject and lighting are supreme.', '2007-08-30 09:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4041111, 578675, 38032, '<td valign="top">I like that this is a different view of balloon than I usually see.  This is especially meaningful considering the recent headlines.</td>', 'I like that this is a different view of balloon than I usually see.  This is especially meaningful considering the recent headlines.', '2007-08-30 09:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4041112, 578299, 38032, '<td valign="top">IMpressive cpture.  I''d like to see a bit more of a blurred background to separate the person from it - but still great.  8</td>', 'IMpressive cpture.  I''d like to see a bit more of a blurred background to separate the person from it - but still great.  8', '2007-08-30 09:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4041115, 578606, 38032, '<td valign="top">A little corny got my taste - but meaningful and clever all the same-  well composed for a contract / stock-photo type shot</td>', 'A little corny got my taste - but meaningful and clever all the same-  well composed for a contract / stock-photo type shot', '2007-08-30 09:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4041118, 578646, 38032, '<td valign="top">Looks like my street this summer.  I won''t hold it against you though ;)</td>', 'Looks like my street this summer.  I won''t hold it against you though ;)', '2007-08-30 09:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4041125, 578622, 38032, '<td valign="top">This isn''t a comment on a photo but I honestly had a dream that myself and a friend were attacked by a dolphin that was riding some sort of above water vehical - which turned out to be a woman that was dressed up like a dolphin.  Later in the dream I realize I was dreaming ... then I tried to fly and fell on my chest - then switched to a scary dream.  Anyway, dolphins are enigma as always!  Interesting play between foreground and background elements!!!!</td>', 'This isn''t a comment on a photo but I honestly had a dream that myself and a friend were attacked by a dolphin that was riding some sort of above water vehical - which turned out to be a woman that was dressed up like a dolphin.  Later in the dream I realize I was dreaming ... then I tried to fly and fell on my chest - then switched to a scary dream.  Anyway, dolphins are enigma as always!  Interesting play between foreground and background elements!!!!', '2007-08-30 09:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4041128, 578641, 38032, '<td valign="top">perfect.  Love it - wouldn''t find me there I''ll tell yahthat!</td>', 'perfect.  Love it - wouldn''t find me there I''ll tell yahthat!', '2007-08-30 09:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4041134, 578469, 38032, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture!  The croud is distant and hazy which works perfectly here. 9</td>', 'Excellent capture!  The croud is distant and hazy which works perfectly here. 9', '2007-08-30 09:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4041145, 578514, 38032, '<td valign="top">I like this push of the challenge.  A bit more contrast might be more dramatic.</td>', 'I like this push of the challenge.  A bit more contrast might be more dramatic.', '2007-08-30 09:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4041147, 577088, 38032, '<td valign="top">oh no! a peach!</td>', 'oh no! a peach!', '2007-08-30 09:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4041150, 578568, 38032, '<td valign="top">beautifully backlit.</td>', 'beautifully backlit.', '2007-08-30 09:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4041152, 576669, 38032, '<td valign="top">awesome tones and stopped motion</td>', 'awesome tones and stopped motion', '2007-08-30 09:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4041198, 576920, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice light and color to this photo.  A less centered and more dynamic composition would really help take this to the next level.</td>', 'Very nice light and color to this photo.  A less centered and more dynamic composition would really help take this to the next level.', '2007-08-30 09:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4041205, 578640, 42100, '<td valign="top">Them stretched out ladders are scary as all get out, anybody that''s ever been on one definitely gets the risk.  The ribs of the roof are very busy and really overwhelm your subject.  A composition that gives more weight to the ladder and worker would help combat that.</td>', 'Them stretched out ladders are scary as all get out, anybody that''s ever been on one definitely gets the risk.  The ribs of the roof are very busy and really overwhelm your subject.  A composition that gives more weight to the ladder and worker would help combat that.', '2007-08-30 09:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4041220, 578556, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice action photo.  A bit underexposed...the hat falling over the eyes is classic and gives this photo a bit of whimsy, bringing that out of shadow would give it more emphasis.</td>', 'Very nice action photo.  A bit underexposed...the hat falling over the eyes is classic and gives this photo a bit of whimsy, bringing that out of shadow would give it more emphasis.', '2007-08-30 10:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4041240, 576965, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great light and composition...a very nice photo.  This meets the challenge title, but not the description, so I ''m sure you''re feeling the brunt of some low votes.  Nothing wrong with stretching the challenge topic as long you''re prepared accept the votes of the hardliners.</td>', 'Great light and composition...a very nice photo.  This meets the challenge title, but not the description, so I ''m sure you''re feeling the brunt of some low votes.  Nothing wrong with stretching the challenge topic as long you''re prepared accept the votes of the hardliners.', '2007-08-30 10:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4041296, 577960, 24913, '<td valign="top">FANTASTIC. Love the idea and the composition. 10</td>', 'FANTASTIC. Love the idea and the composition. 10', '2007-08-30 10:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4041298, 577960, 21367, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of DOF, expression on the cat priceless.  Great shot one of my picks for the top.  Minor distraction in the upper left corner, and I might not have had so much empty space on the right... but still one of my favs...great job.</td>', 'Excellent use of DOF, expression on the cat priceless.  Great shot one of my picks for the top.  Minor distraction in the upper left corner, and I might not have had so much empty space on the right... but still one of my favs...great job.', '2007-08-30 10:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4041326, 578448, 76198, '<td valign="top">Funny pic, but the flash is a bit harsh; highlights blown in hair and dress...</td>', 'Funny pic, but the flash is a bit harsh; highlights blown in hair and dress...', '2007-08-30 11:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4041328, 578109, 81664, '<td valign="top">OH, very clever concept. Film is living on the edge!</td>', 'OH, very clever concept. Film is living on the edge!', '2007-08-30 11:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4041330, 577088, 81664, '<td valign="top">ewe, that is kind of gross. Gave you a 7! Good job!</td>', 'ewe, that is kind of gross. Gave you a 7! Good job!', '2007-08-30 11:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4041331, 578651, 76198, '<td valign="top">In ink? Always! In sharpie? That''s crazy! Better technicals then I expected from the thumbnail...</td>', 'In ink? Always! In sharpie? That''s crazy! Better technicals then I expected from the thumbnail...', '2007-08-30 11:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4041332, 577563, 76198, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really meet the challenge for me. Could use more contrast.</td>', 'Doesn''t really meet the challenge for me. Could use more contrast.', '2007-08-30 11:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4041334, 578651, 81664, '<td valign="top">hahaa, very funny! Clever! Nice shot too!</td>', 'hahaa, very funny! Clever! Nice shot too!', '2007-08-30 11:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4041337, 576527, 76198, '<td valign="top">Cute little guy. Could use more contrast; connection to the challenge is weak.</td>', 'Cute little guy. Could use more contrast; connection to the challenge is weak.', '2007-08-30 11:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4041344, 576527, 81664, '<td valign="top">Awe, he is cute.</td>', 'Awe, he is cute.', '2007-08-30 11:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
