(4041361, 577868, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great photo...the use of negative space gives this an imposing sense of scale and the composition is great.  Something seems a little off on the sharpness(possibly from the processing stage?).</td>', 'Great photo...the use of negative space gives this an imposing sense of scale and the composition is great.  Something seems a little off on the sharpness(possibly from the processing stage?).', '2007-08-30 11:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
