(4042849, 577960, 43031, '<td valign="top">love it, such a great moment and really sells the story. bump to 10</td>', 'love it, such a great moment and really sells the story. bump to 10', '2007-08-31 00:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4042854, 577710, 43031, '<td valign="top">awesome clarity, great moment. the only tick off for a sports photo is no face on the rider, which always translates better and hits home with the viewer. bump to a 9.</td>', 'awesome clarity, great moment. the only tick off for a sports photo is no face on the rider, which always translates better and hits home with the viewer. bump to a 9.', '2007-08-31 00:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4042857, 578171, 43031, '<td valign="top">good photo, backlit without silhouetting or totally blowing out the sky. 9</td>', 'good photo, backlit without silhouetting or totally blowing out the sky. 9', '2007-08-31 00:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4042978, 577155, 5677, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  I love the selective desaturation.  The clarity looks pretty good, and I think you managed to get him at just the ride stage in his kickflip for a great action shot.</td>', 'This is a great shot.  I love the selective desaturation.  The clarity looks pretty good, and I think you managed to get him at just the ride stage in his kickflip for a great action shot.', '2007-08-31 01:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4042981, 576770, 5677, '<td valign="top">Really nice.  The black and white adds emotion to the photo, and I think you did an excellent job with the lighting.</td>', 'Really nice.  The black and white adds emotion to the photo, and I think you did an excellent job with the lighting.', '2007-08-31 01:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4042983, 578622, 5677, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  The color intensity and contrast makes it a really vibrant picture.</td>', 'This is a great shot.  The color intensity and contrast makes it a really vibrant picture.', '2007-08-31 01:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4042987, 578529, 5677, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot.  It''s really sharp and clear.  I''d kind of like to see a color version though to compare with the black and white.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot.  It''s really sharp and clear.  I''d kind of like to see a color version though to compare with the black and white.', '2007-08-31 01:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4042992, 578636, 5677, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I usually like pictures with a lot of contrast, but in this case the lack of contrast really works.  It''s almost like you have to search for the boy a little bit, and I thought that was cool.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I usually like pictures with a lot of contrast, but in this case the lack of contrast really works.  It''s almost like you have to search for the boy a little bit, and I thought that was cool.', '2007-08-31 01:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4043001, 577868, 5677, '<td valign="top">I thought this was a really cool shot.  I love the orange on orange.  You kind of have to look for the guy (like Where''s Waldo?)  I thought that was neat.</td>', 'I thought this was a really cool shot.  I love the orange on orange.  You kind of have to look for the guy (like Where''s Waldo?)  I thought that was neat.', '2007-08-31 01:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4043007, 577906, 5677, '<td valign="top">I guess I wish you have a larger depth of field.  I think it''s a really good composition, and the black and white adds emotion, but I wish I could read the labels on the bottles or the book titles or something that really called my attention to it.</td>', 'I guess I wish you have a larger depth of field.  I think it''s a really good composition, and the black and white adds emotion, but I wish I could read the labels on the bottles or the book titles or something that really called my attention to it.', '2007-08-31 01:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4043087, 578606, 56040, '<td valign="top">Im not sure if the big Expired letters are legal or work as well as a stamp on it would...</td>', 'Im not sure if the big Expired letters are legal or work as well as a stamp on it would...', '2007-08-31 01:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4043089, 578248, 56040, '<td valign="top">working without a net?</td>', 'working without a net?', '2007-08-31 01:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4043093, 576695, 82294, '<td valign="top">Wow! this is a fantastic shot.  Love the gray scale, Focus is very crisp. My pick for the blue ribbon.  Excellent...and I hate skate punks..LOL! Great job.</td>', 'Wow! this is a fantastic shot.  Love the gray scale, Focus is very crisp. My pick for the blue ribbon.  Excellent...and I hate skate punks..LOL! Great job.', '2007-08-31 01:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4043101, 578349, 82294, '<td valign="top">Really excellent shot.  Love the colour, composition, silhouette.  My pick for 2nd place...Should win a ribbon.</td>', 'Really excellent shot.  Love the colour, composition, silhouette.  My pick for 2nd place...Should win a ribbon.', '2007-08-31 01:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4043106, 578675, 82294, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, the perspective is great.  Should win a ribbon,  good job.</td>', 'I really like this shot, the perspective is great.  Should win a ribbon,  good job.', '2007-08-31 01:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4043119, 576357, 82294, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo,  love the colour and composition.  However, I dont get how it meets the challenge.  Therefore it scores down the list for me because of DNMC.  Otherwise, great shot.</td>', 'This is a great photo,  love the colour and composition.  However, I dont get how it meets the challenge.  Therefore it scores down the list for me because of DNMC.  Otherwise, great shot.', '2007-08-31 02:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4043128, 576965, 82294, '<td valign="top">This photo should score very high.  It has very good composition making it an interesting shot.  Very funny title...well maybe a little corny...but hey, I laughed.</td>', 'This photo should score very high.  It has very good composition making it an interesting shot.  Very funny title...well maybe a little corny...but hey, I laughed.', '2007-08-31 02:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4043272, 578516, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Is this stationary stuck to the background with a wire?  If not it must be a very high shutter speed.  Interesting how the flash reflection on front of the mug doesn''t match the shadow position.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Is this stationary stuck to the background with a wire?  If not it must be a very high shutter speed.  Interesting how the flash reflection on front of the mug doesn''t match the shadow position.', '2007-08-31 03:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
