(4043281, 578252, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good capture, but it''s too small and I don''t see where the challenge is met.</td>', 'Good capture, but it''s too small and I don''t see where the challenge is met.', '2007-08-31 03:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
