(4043607, 578124, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great gravity defying stop-action photo.  The background is the drawback here, not only is that construction box butt-ugly, but it''s also in the worst possible place for your photo.  Things like that are tough to see when you''re panning for the capture of a great action photo, so they have to be seen and planned for in advance.</td>', 'Great gravity defying stop-action photo.  The background is the drawback here, not only is that construction box butt-ugly, but it''s also in the worst possible place for your photo.  Things like that are tough to see when you''re panning for the capture of a great action photo, so they have to be seen and planned for in advance.', '2007-08-31 10:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4043662, 578529, 42100, '<td valign="top">You''ve got an interesting subject with this communications tower, but the composition is very static.  The subject divides the photo right down the middle, this doesn''t lead the eye at all.  Leading the eye goes a long way towards a more dynamic photo.  With a human high up on a pole like that, it has the potential to stir up some people if you played with their fear of heights...there are some different composition possibilities that could easily raise some goose bumps.</td>', 'You''ve got an interesting subject with this communications tower, but the composition is very static.  The subject divides the photo right down the middle, this doesn''t lead the eye at all.  Leading the eye goes a long way towards a more dynamic photo.  With a human high up on a pole like that, it has the potential to stir up some people if you played with their fear of heights...there are some different composition possibilities that could easily raise some goose bumps.', '2007-08-31 10:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4043738, 578652, 75192, '<td valign="top">Wow - what are the gold bits?</td>', 'Wow - what are the gold bits?', '2007-08-31 11:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4043739, 576695, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice air.  It''s crowded on the left side with the guy''s fingers just about touching the edge of the frame and two strange lines (tree branches) coming out of the left side.  I think if there was more space ahead of him for him to go into and to more establish the trees on the left it would be improved.  Good interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'Nice air.  It''s crowded on the left side with the guy''s fingers just about touching the edge of the frame and two strange lines (tree branches) coming out of the left side.  I think if there was more space ahead of him for him to go into and to more establish the trees on the left it would be improved.  Good interpretation of the challenge.', '2007-08-31 11:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4043746, 578504, 76430, '<td valign="top">Great timing.  The different backgrounds are a litle distracting.  A shallower DOF would definitely help or else rotate to your right to get just the building behind him.  Better yet, just crop off the right side to get rid of the guy nearby that is walking away as well as the trees.</td>', 'Great timing.  The different backgrounds are a litle distracting.  A shallower DOF would definitely help or else rotate to your right to get just the building behind him.  Better yet, just crop off the right side to get rid of the guy nearby that is walking away as well as the trees.', '2007-08-31 11:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4043762, 578514, 76430, '<td valign="top">This picture would make no sense without the title, looking like a guy thinking, crying, praying, peeking, or something.  Good placement in the frame, but I''d like to see his right shoulder.  It appears his face is noisy, but I think that''s just his complexion.</td>', 'This picture would make no sense without the title, looking like a guy thinking, crying, praying, peeking, or something.  Good placement in the frame, but I''d like to see his right shoulder.  It appears his face is noisy, but I think that''s just his complexion.', '2007-08-31 11:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4043785, 578084, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well I do like the motion blur of the blue car and also the composition is allright but the image is way way too noisy for my taste.  Maybe it would appeal more to me had you reduced the saturation by a whole lot.</td>', 'Well I do like the motion blur of the blue car and also the composition is allright but the image is way way too noisy for my taste.  Maybe it would appeal more to me had you reduced the saturation by a whole lot.', '2007-08-31 11:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
