(4052329, 578248, 33535, '<td valign="top">haha, it took me a while to get this...<br/>she''s quite beautiful, the lighting is ok, the crop is too tight on the right.<br/>otherwise good shot, made me laugh and look closer ;)</td>', 'haha, it took me a while to get this...she''s quite beautiful, the lighting is ok, the crop is too tight on the right.otherwise good shot, made me laugh and look closer ;)', '2007-09-03 06:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4052419, 578341, 74078, '<td valign="top">Scary to think that these jobs were once done without harnesses. Great capture for this challenge. Only thing that could make it better is that it might be a bit crisper. Nice work though.</td>', 'Scary to think that these jobs were once done without harnesses. Great capture for this challenge. Only thing that could make it better is that it might be a bit crisper. Nice work though.', '2007-09-03 08:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4052424, 578622, 74078, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture. Such graceful creatures. Pity that the background is the same colour as the water. It would look awesome with some clever editing to darken out the background. Great one. Good luck</td>', 'Beautiful capture. Such graceful creatures. Pity that the background is the same colour as the water. It would look awesome with some clever editing to darken out the background. Great one. Good luck', '2007-09-03 08:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4052425, 578498, 74078, '<td valign="top">Where was the photographer standing here????? Sorry but this is very fitting for the challenge, but IMO has the appearance of a snapshot rather than a challenge entry. 6</td>', 'Where was the photographer standing here????? Sorry but this is very fitting for the challenge, but IMO has the appearance of a snapshot rather than a challenge entry. 6', '2007-09-03 08:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4052427, 578630, 74078, '<td valign="top">Great lines and the red colouring is very effective to add something to the shot. Good luck</td>', 'Great lines and the red colouring is very effective to add something to the shot. Good luck', '2007-09-03 08:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4052428, 578299, 74078, '<td valign="top">I like the shot however I think that some of he wow factor is lost due to the fact that the glider is lost within the foreground landscape. 6</td>', 'I like the shot however I think that some of he wow factor is lost due to the fact that the glider is lost within the foreground landscape. 6', '2007-09-03 08:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4052431, 576695, 74078, '<td valign="top">So many times you see these things go wrong. I bet they wished they had a net sometimes. Very nice processing on a well done shot.</td>', 'So many times you see these things go wrong. I bet they wished they had a net sometimes. Very nice processing on a well done shot.', '2007-09-03 08:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4052432, 578646, 74078, '<td valign="top">Nice workplace shot. I think that it would have more impact if the highlights were dampened down a bit. This type of processing looks much more effective to my eye if it is slightly darker than normal. Nice work though 6</td>', 'Nice workplace shot. I think that it would have more impact if the highlights were dampened down a bit. This type of processing looks much more effective to my eye if it is slightly darker than normal. Nice work though 6', '2007-09-03 08:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4052433, 578013, 74078, '<td valign="top">Crazy cowboys. I would need more than a net to get onto the back of one of those. Nice action shot. Good luck</td>', 'Crazy cowboys. I would need more than a net to get onto the back of one of those. Nice action shot. Good luck', '2007-09-03 08:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4052438, 578640, 74078, '<td valign="top">This shot could be quite deceiving. He could be 100ft high for all we know, or he could be a 10ft ladders length from the bottom. Still, it is a fitting shot for this challenge. As for the shot, plenty of lines however, unfortunately not a lot to grab my attention. Hope you do well though. 6</td>', 'This shot could be quite deceiving. He could be 100ft high for all we know, or he could be a 10ft ladders length from the bottom. Still, it is a fitting shot for this challenge. As for the shot, plenty of lines however, unfortunately not a lot to grab my attention. Hope you do well though. 6', '2007-09-03 08:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4052440, 577022, 74078, '<td valign="top">Elegant. Subject appears slightly OOF to me though. Maybe it is just my eyes after too much voting. Great use of colours and positioning of the main subject in the centre of the shot. 6</td>', 'Elegant. Subject appears slightly OOF to me though. Maybe it is just my eyes after too much voting. Great use of colours and positioning of the main subject in the centre of the shot. 6', '2007-09-03 08:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4052449, 578608, 74078, '<td valign="top">Wished so much that this image was sharper. It has the prospects to be a ribbon winner, but I feel that it will be let down by its lack of sharpness.</td>', 'Wished so much that this image was sharper. It has the prospects to be a ribbon winner, but I feel that it will be let down by its lack of sharpness.', '2007-09-03 08:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4052451, 578124, 74078, '<td valign="top">I love the facial expressions these guys get when they are deep in concentration. Nice shot and good luck</td>', 'I love the facial expressions these guys get when they are deep in concentration. Nice shot and good luck', '2007-09-03 08:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4052459, 578654, 74078, '<td valign="top">That has got to hurt your shoulders. Nice shot, but I fear that it might not do all that well. Not sure what it is, but it just doesn''t leap out at me and say vote high. Hope that a 6 will help you on your way as I just dont want to vote low because of something I cannot put my finger on.</td>', 'That has got to hurt your shoulders. Nice shot, but I fear that it might not do all that well. Not sure what it is, but it just doesn''t leap out at me and say vote high. Hope that a 6 will help you on your way as I just dont want to vote low because of something I cannot put my finger on.', '2007-09-03 08:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4052461, 578469, 74078, '<td valign="top">This is one instance that I have seen where you would be in trouble with or without a net. Nice one. Did he make it through? 6</td>', 'This is one instance that I have seen where you would be in trouble with or without a net. Nice one. Did he make it through? 6', '2007-09-03 08:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4052463, 578087, 74078, '<td valign="top">I like the image, but think that it might have looked better if the reflections of the sun on the pillars were not so bright. Good Luck 6</td>', 'I like the image, but think that it might have looked better if the reflections of the sun on the pillars were not so bright. Good Luck 6', '2007-09-03 08:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
