(4056090, 578548, 67697, '<td valign="top">Earl was very tired after a long week of tending horses so on Saturday he decided to pamper himself.  While driving home, Earl stuck his hand out the window to admire his first-ever manicure!  As he was looking, he noticed something odd on one of his nails.  Horrors!  A hangnail!   While Earl was focused on getting a closer inspection, he inadvertantly drove over to the wrong side of the street, up over a curb, and plowed thru some yards and into a pool.  Poor Earl never saw it coming. <br/> <br/>heh - you be crazy lady!</td>', 'Earl was very tired after a long week of tending horses so on Saturday he decided to pamper himself.  While driving home, Earl stuck his hand out the window to admire his first-ever manicure!  As he was looking, he noticed something odd on one of his nails.  Horrors!  A hangnail!   While Earl was focused on getting a closer inspection, he inadvertantly drove over to the wrong side of the street, up over a curb, and plowed thru some yards and into a pool.  Poor Earl never saw it coming.  heh - you be crazy lady!', '2007-09-04 10:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
