(4067116, 577172, 12268, '<td valign="top">I gotta say, this is  great shot. Pix that are unlike any other shot in the challenge for some reason, bizarre to me, always tend to do quite poorly. I only hope that you don''t put too much credence in the many votes and comments of folks that harp on, IMHO, idiotic things as hotspots, "don''t see how it fits..." blah blah blah, and the like. I am never one to say it but it just seems so narrow-minded to me.<br/> <br/>This is an imaginative shot and fits the challenge figuratively but in a nice creative way. Too bad for those who just can''t see the beauty in this shot.<br/> <br/>Well done!</td>', 'I gotta say, this is  great shot. Pix that are unlike any other shot in the challenge for some reason, bizarre to me, always tend to do quite poorly. I only hope that you don''t put too much credence in the many votes and comments of folks that harp on, IMHO, idiotic things as hotspots, "don''t see how it fits..." blah blah blah, and the like. I am never one to say it but it just seems so narrow-minded to me. This is an imaginative shot and fits the challenge figuratively but in a nice creative way. Too bad for those who just can''t see the beauty in this shot. Well done!', '2007-09-06 23:23:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4067143, 578641, 76676, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Strikeslip:</b></div><hr/><i> You bastard, my shot placed right below yours!  Nice shot! :-) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>See what happens when you suggest I boost colors, sharpness and contrast in my images.<br/> <br/>Too bad it isnt working for my free study, and Bokeh entry ;-D<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-09-06 22:32:59.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Strikeslip: You bastard, my shot placed right below yours!  Nice shot! :-)   See what happens when you suggest I boost colors, sharpness and contrast in my images. Too bad it isnt working for my free study, and Bokeh entry ;-D', '2007-09-06 23:31:30.000000', '2007-09-06 23:32:59.000000', 0),
