(4071709, 578612, 30982, '<td valign="top">Didn''t get a chance to vote this challenge but am completely not understanding the score at all.  Not that score is a biggie, but I''m a bit baffled.  Meets the challenge quite well, love the composition (nice little "v" that Jayson note) and I happen to have a thing for backlighting so I''m big on that part too.  Nice job bringing out just enough details in the guys, and I like the subdued color trick.  I''ve done that a bit lately as well (though by different means.)  Nice where appropriate, and in this case, it''s appropriate.  But I think I will submit you for a DQ for lying in the title....</td>', 'Didn''t get a chance to vote this challenge but am completely not understanding the score at all.  Not that score is a biggie, but I''m a bit baffled.  Meets the challenge quite well, love the composition (nice little "v" that Jayson note) and I happen to have a thing for backlighting so I''m big on that part too.  Nice job bringing out just enough details in the guys, and I like the subdued color trick.  I''ve done that a bit lately as well (though by different means.)  Nice where appropriate, and in this case, it''s appropriate.  But I think I will submit you for a DQ for lying in the title....', '2007-09-08 07:07:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4071710, 578516, 30982, '<td valign="top">You are the king of subtle but very appropriate challenge interpretations.  I really your take on this and I like the blues.  Kind of appropriate for the kind of day one would be having if the coffee mug did indeed fall and break.</td>', 'You are the king of subtle but very appropriate challenge interpretations.  I really your take on this and I like the blues.  Kind of appropriate for the kind of day one would be having if the coffee mug did indeed fall and break.', '2007-09-08 07:09:42.000000', NULL, 0),
