(4075064, 578171, 67697, '<td valign="top">A perfect, timely example of working without a net.  The barbed wire in silhouette really hammers home the message.  Also, the big bright sun in the background strongly emphasizes the heat of the working environment.  As usual, Deb, there are so many interesting details to browse thru here.</td>', 'A perfect, timely example of working without a net.  The barbed wire in silhouette really hammers home the message.  Also, the big bright sun in the background strongly emphasizes the heat of the working environment.  As usual, Deb, there are so many interesting details to browse thru here.', '2007-09-09 14:37:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4075079, 578612, 67697, '<td valign="top">I find that score to be incredibly low.  Even without the title, I easily get the impression that they are working on a roof.  What I find funny is that it looks like the two on the right might be tethered together.  So if one falls, at least he doesn''t fall alone lol.  I''m also curious about what they are putting on the roof.  Interesting photo that should have scored higher.</td>', 'I find that score to be incredibly low.  Even without the title, I easily get the impression that they are working on a roof.  What I find funny is that it looks like the two on the right might be tethered together.  So if one falls, at least he doesn''t fall alone lol.  I''m also curious about what they are putting on the roof.  Interesting photo that should have scored higher.', '2007-09-09 14:44:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4075187, 578171, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great finish but I hate you being there to take that shot. ;~(</td>', 'Great finish but I hate you being there to take that shot. ;~(', '2007-09-09 15:32:36.000000', NULL, 0),
