(4079281, 578513, 52142, '<td valign="top">I wish to thank everyone who took the time to leave a comment. Most of them are helpful in one way or another. <br/>In the description I wrote that the yellow thing was an earthmover so it''s baffling why so many people couldn''t figure it out. Maybe I used a wrong word, larus called it a bulldozer. <br/>I hope to do better next time.<br/></td>', 'I wish to thank everyone who took the time to leave a comment. Most of them are helpful in one way or another. In the description I wrote that the yellow thing was an earthmover so it''s baffling why so many people couldn''t figure it out. Maybe I used a wrong word, larus called it a bulldozer. I hope to do better next time.', '2007-09-10 21:17:13.000000', NULL, 0),
