(4094091, 578171, 61651, '<td valign="top">About as without a net as one could possibly be, although I suppose that could be said regardless of which side of the wire you happened to be on in this location.  Perfect for the challenge.  I especially like that bright disc of a sun dominating the landscape.</td>', 'About as without a net as one could possibly be, although I suppose that could be said regardless of which side of the wire you happened to be on in this location.  Perfect for the challenge.  I especially like that bright disc of a sun dominating the landscape.', '2007-09-16 16:21:18.000000', NULL, 0),
