(4495074, 578548, 68947, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by WTrelease:</b></div><hr/><i> This should be "Hidden due to content".  Vulgarity is a slippery slope, I hope DPChallenge doesn''t slide down it. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Odd, William, how people can consider almost "pornographic" nudity in some of the shots in here as "acceptable" and term it "art"...but, show someone''s middle finger and all of a sudden, it''s "a slippery slope" that could be sliding DPC downwards???  <br/> <br/>I''m sorry that you didn''t get the idea that it wasn''t a "comment" or "statement" but rather a joke!  A "gutsy" one at that but, all the same...a joke!  Perhaps, had you looked upon it in that manner, it wouldn''t have appeared as "vulgarity" to you.  <br/> <br/>Sorry, I refuse to mark your comment as "helpful" because it wasn''t aimed at being helpful to my photo.  Rather it was aimed at making a statement period to others of your distaste.</td>', 'Originally posted by WTrelease: This should be "Hidden due to content".  Vulgarity is a slippery slope, I hope DPChallenge doesn''t slide down it.   Odd, William, how people can consider almost "pornographic" nudity in some of the shots in here as "acceptable" and term it "art"...but, show someone''s middle finger and all of a sudden, it''s "a slippery slope" that could be sliding DPC downwards???   I''m sorry that you didn''t get the idea that it wasn''t a "comment" or "statement" but rather a joke!  A "gutsy" one at that but, all the same...a joke!  Perhaps, had you looked upon it in that manner, it wouldn''t have appeared as "vulgarity" to you.   Sorry, I refuse to mark your comment as "helpful" because it wasn''t aimed at being helpful to my photo.  Rather it was aimed at making a statement period to others of your distaste.', '2008-02-18 16:43:13.000000', NULL, 0),
